    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize and build your own car! This hardcore automotive game requires basic car knowledge, allowing highly free adjustment of performance parameters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, design your vehicle\u2019s appearance with voxel-based modular building blocks for limitless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-made templates are provided for inspiration if you need guidance!(There's a simple step-by-step tutorial in the intro video.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, create a completely unique car to conquer race tracks and off-road challenges! Compete online with friends and showcase your engineering masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This game is independently developed by a solo creator pursuing a game-design dream. Overcoming countless challenges from programming, 3D modeling, to technical art \u2013 every aspect was self-taught from scratch. Your support is greatly appreciated!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08Looking for tutorials, reporting bugs, or finding friends to play together? Click the link to join the QQ group or Discord.\uff09</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize and build your own car! This hardcore automotive game requires basic car knowledge, allowing highly free adjustment of performance parameters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, design your vehicle\u2019s appearance with voxel-based modular building blocks for limitless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-made templates are provided for inspiration if you need guidance!(There's a simple step-by-step tutorial in the intro video.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, create a completely unique car to conquer race tracks and off-road challenges! Compete online with friends and showcase your engineering masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This game is independently developed by a solo creator pursuing a game-design dream. Overcoming countless challenges from programming, 3D modeling, to technical art \u2013 every aspect was self-taught from scratch. Your support is greatly appreciated!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08Looking for tutorials, reporting bugs, or finding friends to play together? Click the link to join the QQ group or Discord.\uff09</p>",
    "short_description": "Design the car completely by yourself! Performance and appearance are all Designed by yourself! Drive the car all designed by yourself to conquer all the tracks~",
